<title>UK: DEUTSCHE BANK SETS DOLLAR/MARK CALL WARRANTS.</title>
<headline>DEUTSCHE BANK SETS DOLLAR/MARK CALL WARRANTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, Frankfurt said it has issued</p>
<p>two million European-style call warrants, on the dollar/mark exchange rate.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1.90 DEM		  ISSUE PRICE  5.0 DEM</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	14.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSSELDORF     MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  US$/DEM 1.8876</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
